message:
feat(harness): trust a refused workspace and retry the start once

A failed save removes a newly made worktree and shows an error;
declining fails the start as not trusted.

feat(sessions): add an Incognito project rooted at /tmp/orb-incognito

It is added at every start and kept out of the new-session picker;
its folder is remade before each Incognito draft starts.

feat(worktrees): sweep unused orb worktrees at start and hourly

Worktrees nothing uses are removed, settled ones after seven days;
attached, busy, draft and dirty ones stay, and branches are kept.
